      "text": {
        "jp": "あのキラキラのことなんだけど……。\r\nもう一度、よく考えてみたら、\r\nクリスタルの輝きとは違うような……。",
        "official_en": "But that shimmering light... I thought about it some more, and it feels different from a Crystal’s light.",
        "real_en": null
