      "text": {
        "jp": "あんまり思いつめないでさ、\r\nダメでもともとぐらいの気持ちで行こうぜ。",
        "official_en": "No need to overthink it. It’s not like we’ve got anything to lose, really.",
        "real_en": "Don't dwell on it too much. Let's go in knowing it might not work out."
